===Quantity chance===
Notably, this calculation picks a random integer between 0 and the maximum amount awardable inclusive, then raises the outcome up to the minimum.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1341736090844213248|date=23 December 2020|archiveurl=https://archive.ph/3cuos|archivedate=17 January 2023|quote=Ah, sorry, looks like I misread it. It's picking a random integer 0-max inclusive, then raising the result up to the minimum. So if the min were 2 and the max were 4, it'd roll 0, 1, 2, 3, 4 with equal chance, then apply a minimum of 2 by changing those outcomes to 2, 2, 2, 3, 4.}} As a result, lower outcomes are comparatively likelier: at level 100 or above, players have a 3/5 chance to receive 2 grubs; a 1/5 chance to receive 3 grubs; and a 1/5 chance to receive 4 grubs.-->

